Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 18:51:55 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] =?UTF-8?q?fix(web):=20Vercel=20build=20xatosini=20tuz?=
 =?UTF-8?q?atish=20=E2=80=94=20set-cookie-parser=20va=20phantom=20deps?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

react-router@7.18.3 va pkg-types@2.3.1 o'z deps'larini e'lon qiladi,
lekin eski package-lock.json ularni to'g'ri yozmagan edi — natijada
Vercel'da `Cannot find package 'set-cookie-parser'` xatosi.

- apps/web ga set-cookie-parser ni ochiq qo'shish (xavfsizlik uchun)
- package-lock.json ni toza qayta yaratish
- .npmrc da legacy-peer-deps=true — @types/react-dom peer konflikti uchun

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .npmrc                |   1 +
 apps/web/package.json |   1 +
 package-lock.json     | Bin 791277 -> 620138 bytes
 3 files changed, 2 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 .npmrc

diff --git a/.npmrc b/.npmrc
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..521a9f7
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.npmrc
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+legacy-peer-deps=true
diff --git a/apps/web/package.json b/apps/web/package.json
index a713684..3e1c95f 100644
--- a/apps/web/package.json
+++ b/apps/web/package.json
@@ -46,6 +46,7 @@
     "react-dom": "^18.3.1",
     "react-router": "^7.18.3",
     "react-router-dom": "^7.18.3",
+    "set-cookie-parser": "^2.7.1",
     "sonner": "^2.0.8",
     "tailwind-merge": "^2.6.0",
     "three": "^0.166.1"
diff --git a/package-lock.json b/package-lock.json
index 003d1816d74019bc9694134af5f41feffb812b8a..7be3139a4d8a3f880ee7bfb3865f571344fbcd89 100644
